{
"file": 9,
"paths": [
"d002/f597"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "97f126e6",
"en_raw": "And then, as you walk up the stairs"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "7323558b",
"en_raw": "a voice speaks by your ear..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "290dafca",
"en_raw": "You should have fallen"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "7a6e6567",
"en_raw": "Oh, Sango, you know it too?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "ea979cc3",
"en_raw": "I read about it in a book"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "7382df5d",
"en_raw": "About ten similar ones"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "a91470fb",
"en_raw": "It's a famous rumor"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "95ca6085",
"en_raw": "A very typical rumor"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "760d3156",
"en_raw": "But those stairs"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "26b8a357",
"en_raw": "are a handy route, yet"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "35d175f3",
"en_raw": "really few people use them"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "cdeac4fa",
"en_raw": "from the place with the Jizo statue"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "bd022020",
"en_raw": "they link the hilltop and the station"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "f628ffa2",
"en_raw": "in a straight line, too"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "895675ef",
"en_raw": "Hardly anyone's used them"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "4a1c4bc6",
"en_raw": "for a long time, right?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "e4d3100b",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "a9a863a4",
"en_raw": "Come to think of it, remember?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "493326d9",
"en_raw": "In elementary school, those stairs"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "f02021f6",
"en_raw": "were closed off"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "28ab751c",
"en_raw": "Yeah, that happened"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "9ca1a0c8",
"en_raw": "And then a really roundabout"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "14e8c2e3",
"en_raw": "school route was made"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "7c87f2ef",
"en_raw": "Is that connected to the rumor?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "6bb6b14c",
"en_raw": "I thought it was just because it's dangerous"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "400eadb7",
"en_raw": "Now that you say it"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "d487f85e",
"en_raw": "it does bug me somehow"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "384e86d1",
"en_raw": "Never mind, let's not"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "89e60d3d",
"en_raw": "What if I miss a step..."
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "69431beb",
"en_raw": "Ugh, what a coward"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "16c02c6f",
"en_raw": "Shiina, tell him too"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "b473718f",
"en_raw": "Nao, you coward!"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "3432937a",
"en_raw": "The question is back in elementary school"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "6cd690f7",
"en_raw": "why those stairs"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "76767ecc",
"en_raw": "became impassable"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "4afec640",
"en_raw": "What happened back then?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "3897ce7d",
"en_raw": "Doesn't anyone remember?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "7302631f",
"en_raw": "What about the big stairs?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "1b4346d9",
"en_raw": "Examining the scene matters, but"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "1664394c",
"en_raw": "taking witness testimony is also"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "e64d6495",
"en_raw": "an important part of an investigation"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "3e0821ca",
"en_raw": "That's common sense, right?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "bb3146f4",
"en_raw": "...I don't think there was"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "246d1510",
"en_raw": "a murder or anything"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "9ec79ea8",
"en_raw": "I'm curious about the stairs"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "0eec8599",
"en_raw": "Start from the shopping street on the hill"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "97a66037",
"en_raw": "...it's close to my place"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "c0c98745",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao, did you hear that?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "1fa65a7a",
"en_raw": "What is?"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "2577b6d1",
"en_raw": "...Just fall"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "01480076",
"en_raw": "Of course I didn't hear anything"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "7a071b3c",
"en_raw": "I might have heard it"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "0c43c066",
"en_raw": "No way, it's a lie"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "aaf22277",
"en_raw": "But, you know, something"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "050a1b62",
"en_raw": "felt dangerous, that's a fact"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "2cb23ac2",
"en_raw": "...That height"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "f03aff28",
"en_raw": "If your legs tangle from lack of sleep"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "a0fa9e50",
"en_raw": "you'd go straight to heaven"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "c9f35ad0",
"en_raw": "He won't look at me"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "3bd22f9b",
"en_raw": "That's not true"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "70ede6d3",
"en_raw": "I'm listening to Shiina's story too"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "14bf720f",
"en_raw": "No, the man on the stairs..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "ebc58bcd",
"en_raw": "Kurumi will call out once more"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "fb5214fa",
"en_raw": "...I've had enough"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "11681a72",
"en_raw": "of those stairs..."
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "3a6b3860",
"en_raw": "See, I told you"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "25c1ad45",
"en_raw": "That's how rumors are"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "9ba6675f",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "d21408a7",
"en_raw": "No smoke without fire, as they say"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "27e4e24b",
"en_raw": "I can't tell if it's connected"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "8370c216",
"en_raw": "to the closure back then"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "4df77d21",
"en_raw": "The scene it is, then... maybe"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "18a7bdc4",
"en_raw": "traces of the accident remain"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "6e621687",
"en_raw": "Shiina, let's go to the stairs"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "c623112c",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi wants to lead"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "1991fd72",
"en_raw": "and go up and down"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "eb091077",
"en_raw": "the stairs"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "6b8390b2",
"en_raw": "If it's Shiina's playtime"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "1f3afc38",
"en_raw": "do it tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "b4cb066d",
"en_raw": "I want to investigate"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "0f40f446",
"en_raw": "...But today's haul"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "e0a3ceb8",
"en_raw": "might be about this much"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "81a20bfc",
"en_raw": "I bet everyone doesn't remember"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "a795e272",
"en_raw": "the incident well"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "4d5380a2",
"en_raw": "It was a long time ago..."
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "d67b7205",
"en_raw": "That's unnatural"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "50333d15",
"en_raw": "A fall accident is more memorable"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "39c0a853",
"en_raw": "than a traffic accident, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "34b4778f",
"en_raw": "But they say they don't know"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "37b58308",
"en_raw": "so it can't be helped"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "d013e5c5",
"en_raw": "I'm just not convinced"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "9035cec4",
"en_raw": "Let me ask a little more"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "b20264c7",
"en_raw": "Casually, but persistently"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "95be2e6c",
"en_raw": "...You're still going?"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "055eb614",
"en_raw": "In cases like this"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "213d41d5",
"en_raw": "old people seem to know"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "1b8245b2",
"en_raw": "all sorts of things"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "c65d1fe5",
"en_raw": "That man on the slope, after all..."
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "03d4c66b",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, you know"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "f793e190",
"en_raw": "the man went away"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "3976fa33",
"en_raw": "If he knows, he should just"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "c1d760ac",
"en_raw": "tell us everything"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "fb22b194",
"en_raw": "That old man is actually"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "f4495ae5",
"en_raw": "kind of mean, for how he looks"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "c0c38209",
"en_raw": "Maybe Sango's way of asking"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "0bfb338c",
"en_raw": "is rude?"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "5ea7b4e5",
"en_raw": "What's rude about it?"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "5d0ee741",
"en_raw": "My manners"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "2e47f3c0",
"en_raw": "are perfect"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "4f561d70",
"en_raw": "At this rate I'll get the truth"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "aa79ffa7",
"en_raw": "out of the greengrocer"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "77fdd01f",
"en_raw": "It's weird, definitely"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "50e34793",
"en_raw": "Why would he need to tell"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "db9ad8a5",
"en_raw": "such an obvious lie?"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "8e9782df",
"en_raw": "Does he think we're kids"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "63d01ef5",
"en_raw": "and is making fun of us?"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "9570c9fc",
"en_raw": "Then say that"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "96dd84b2",
"en_raw": "to the old man on the hill"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "de84b900",
"en_raw": "and ask him again"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "5e3b590d",
"en_raw": "The voice on the big stairs"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "05ba0385",
"en_raw": "saying 'just fall', what is it?"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "02597cac",
"en_raw": "...It's, you see"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "ccb8e954",
"en_raw": "You're going to say it's a hoax, right?"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "e3f2797a",
"en_raw": "No, it's guilt"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "26525648",
"en_raw": "...Guilt?"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "36c30b99",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "fdcbfd7b",
"en_raw": "Feeling like you've done something wrong"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "5c00a2b9",
"en_raw": "as you pass those stairs"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "dc4eef3b",
"en_raw": "you end up feeling like"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "9de72919",
"en_raw": "you heard a voice"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "d2f024e9",
"en_raw": "...The accident really"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "2d4d93a3",
"en_raw": "did happen, after all"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "aced46b8",
"en_raw": "So if Nao walks it"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "e6112d4d",
"en_raw": "he might get pushed"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "b8ce61a7",
"en_raw": "That's all you ever say, Sango"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "28149dc6",
"en_raw": "Shiina, what do you think?"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "c21842f9",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "4d3c5c86",
"en_raw": "That story about the stairs"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "210bef26",
"en_raw": "Um, Kurumi thinks"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "e6e019d5",
"en_raw": "...Oh, right! Right!"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "f4285b7d",
"en_raw": "From the moment they're born"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "16f2a8d0",
"en_raw": "until they die, people are alone"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "7c0d9aa2",
"en_raw": "What's that?"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "2d343d8b",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi has"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "19a4423a",
"en_raw": "a daddy"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "d4fa0ccf",
"en_raw": "and a mommy"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "0f14bcd0",
"en_raw": "and Kou-kun"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "81bc810f",
"en_raw": "and Sango"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "65e91c7f",
"en_raw": "and Melos, right?"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "fee1b0d9",
"en_raw": "So"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "cc1df4a0",
"en_raw": "So... I'm not alone"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "ce2ab6fd",
"en_raw": "I didn't ask for that"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "d9bac8a0",
"en_raw": "Shiina... what about me?"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "ea706dc3",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Ghost on the Stairs!"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "121e183d",
"en_raw": "But Sango, since then"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "01bd6cc7",
"en_raw": "I haven't heard that rumor"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "0c949f07",
"en_raw": "It was Shiina who brought it up"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "94dccd9c",
"en_raw": "in the first place"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "5faba2ff",
"en_raw": "Feels like either way is fine now"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "247ae1bf",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "e9fb93e9",
"en_raw": "Either way is fine, I guess"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "c392b464",
"en_raw": "The old man tried so hard"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "acdb9847",
"en_raw": "to tell us..."
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "85e5dc01",
"en_raw": "If I thought about dying now"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "ab2ec719",
"en_raw": "I couldn't go on living"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}